        <abstract>
            <para>This dataset includes data on occurrences of 11 threatened tree species, trees recorded in point-centred quarter (PCQ) plots around many individuals of those 11 tree species, and an inventory of plant species along 65 trails surveyed between Oct 2020 to Mar 2022 in rainforests of the Valparai Plateau and Anamalai Tiger Reserve, Western Ghats, India.</para>
        </abstract>
